      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is a roughly 100 nm reactive-sputtered CrN interlayer between the elemental Cr coating and the zirconium-alloy substrate.",
